From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Clark <robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 06:19:58 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] drm/msm/a8xx: Add all CP_PROTECT_PIPE to pwrup reglist

We're going to start using more of the CP_PROTECT_PIPE regs.  Rather
than missing to restore one somewhere, just add them all to the pwrup
reglist.

Tested-by: Alexander Koskovich <akoskovich@pm.me> # Milos (Nothing Phone 3a)
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Rob Clark <robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261109142111.256630-13-robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com
[ from the linux-arm-msm archive: v8 12/15 of "drm/msm/a8xx: GPU state capture support" (9 Nov 2026); not applied upstream yet ]
